        },
        {
          "text": " Kolemut Sem ka Yapet elou, kibwaikis okeperinikec kere, kobonobonoto ekaukau, kimukosi papakec kinye amuialal; ido kanueteoto kinaren, mam apotu koanyut papakec imujalal. ",
